  m_Text: When you go back to Main Menu you will either create or join a game. If
    you create the game you will have to send the join code to whoever else wants
    to play. Keep in mind when entering the join code the letters should be all caps.
    You also have to add in your name but it will only work if you hit the 'Save
    Name' button.
