  m_Text: Your secret identity is hidden in a folder so that no one can see it. The
    yellow card will tell you what party you are affiliated with. The tan card behind
    that will tell you your role in that party. Liberal = GoodGuy, Fascist = Bad
    Guy, and Hitler = Guy Bad.
