    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "The year is 1932. The place is pre-WWII Germany.\r\nIn Guy Bad, players
    are German politicians\r\nattempting to hold a fragile Good Guy government\r\ntogether
    and stem the rising tide of Bad Guy-ism.\r\nWatch out though\u2014there are secret
    Bad Guys among\r\nyou, and one player is Guy Bad.\r"
