  m_Text: Another feature is that if no President is elected for three rounds then
    a random card is selected and put on the board. There are more Bad Guy policy
    cards then Good Guys so be careful. The majority of roles go to Good Guys but
    it will be hard to tell who is who with no facial expressions.
