    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: Every round a President and a Chancellor are elected or it's passed on
    to the next player. You can either vote 'Ja' or 'Nein'. But if you get elected
    then the President will be given 3 policy cards, He will discard one by clicking
    on it and the other 2 are sent to the Chancellor, the Chancellor clicks one to
    discard it and the last card is set on the table with the corresponding board.
