  m_Text: Once in the game you will only be able to rotate around, you cannot move
    anymore. But now you will see some new things on your screen. There is a player
    list, reactions, live chat, and your secret identity hidden in a folder. All
    of these applications can be closed with the 'X' button on each of them except
    the secret identity.
