  m_Text: The two boards in the center of the table are to keep track of which party
    has more points. Whoever fills their board first is the party that wins. But
    the Guy Bad board has powers if they get too many policies in. The powers will
    go to the current President. But if the Bad Guy board is half full and Guy Bad
    is elected as Chancellor then the Bad Guys win.
